# Phase 8 - Project Summary

## Project
Script-Controlled ACL – Restrict Record Access Based on Field Value

## Platform
ServiceNow

## Table
Incident

## Operation
Read

## Field
Priority

## Security Logic

Critical incidents are restricted to administrators.

Non-admin users can access incidents when the Priority
is not Critical.

## Technologies Used

- ServiceNow
- ACL
- JavaScript
- Role-based access control

## Outcome

The project demonstrates how a Script-Controlled ACL can
dynamically control record access based on a field value.
